{
  "about": "Every spelling of a credential rex's log masks (rust/src/runtime/logging.rs, redact) and rex-android's Logs.kt redact() hides too. The same file, byte for byte, is rex's tests/fixtures/log_redaction_cases.json and rex-android's app/src/test/resources/redaction/log_redaction_cases.json: change both together. Each case's secrets must be gone from the redacted line and each kept string still in it. The app hides more (public addresses, other keys, opaque path segments), so the lines use none of those.",
